# Hit zones on the creatures (graphics/mesh/hitzones): the hero turns into each (transform) and the zones are
# measured against its body: with the guess by the bone names (zones fit off), then fitted to the mesh (on), shot
# from the side and from the front quarter with the capsules drawn (overlay zones). The report: "Hit zones"
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_01
turn 225
wait 500
overlay zones
showzones player
zones fit off
wait 200
say == Hero off
zones player
transform Wolf
wait 600
say == Wolf off
zones player
transform back
wait 300
